MeTube / fnOS packaging notices
===============================

MeTube is licensed under GNU AGPL-3.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/alexta69/metube

This fnOS package is an unofficial native x86_64 packaging.

The generated FPK bundles:
- FFmpeg 7.0.2-static, Linux x86_64
- Source package used by the builder: imageio-ffmpeg 0.6.0
- Static build provenance: https://johnvansickle.com/ffmpeg/
- Expected SHA256:
  e7e7fb30477f717e6f55f9180a70386c62677ef8a4d4d1a5d948f4098aa3eb99
- GNU GPL v3 license text is included at:
  app/native/vendor/FFMPEG_GPL-3.0.txt

FFprobe is prepared on first fnOS installation from
@ffprobe-installer/linux-x64@5.2.0 through npm.

MeTube source and the rest of the runtime are prepared for the corresponding
upstream tag during fnOS installation.
